abstract: >-
  Exact rational certificate data and deterministic replay tools accompanying
  the existing k=2, m=4 Magic Number preprint. CERTIFICATE_INDEX.md connects paper
  claims to stable certificate identifiers, literal data, and verification
  commands. Code is licensed under MIT; manuscript, documentation, and original
  data under CC BY 4.0. Archive DOI: [ZENODO DOI TO BE INSERTED AFTER RELEASE].
